SUMMARY
-------------------------------------------------------------------------
The set-exclusion rewrite holds. The defect class of attempts 1 and 2 is now
structurally unreachable rather than patched: no living formula can read a
PlanExcluded* value (grep-proven), LivingOutflows is the single exclusion
implementation with HI-first precedence guarded at both the annotation and
the living layer, and both rulings' probes produce the correct figure through
the real Calculate (3000/-500 and 3000/+500). A control mutation proves the
set exclusion is load-bearing before any other mutation is trusted; twelve
mutations in total, every one killed, including the three wiring mutants that
close my own attempt-1 F1. nil-map behavior equals master's bit-for-bit on
the arithmetic spot-check. The walk-invariant break the worker attributed to
master is confirmed master-native by my own both-ends probe — the FAIL-grade
tripwire is not tripped. Scope is exactly SY4.3.files; all 15 files are
byte-identical after every mutation.
